k-rev t-until-cxx26\">(removed in C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  implements character array input operations <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ostrstream\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ostrstream</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-deprecated-cxx98\">(deprecated in C++98)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx26\">(removed in C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  implements character array output operations <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/strstream\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>strstream</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-deprecated-cxx98\">(deprecated in C++98)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx26\">(removed in C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  implements character array input/output operations <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n<span id=\"Synchronized_output\"></span>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Synchronized_output_.28since_C.2B.2B20.29\">Synchronized output <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/syncstream\">&lt;syncstream&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_syncbuf\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>basic_syncbuf</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  synchronized output device wrapper <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"