ev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_syncbuf\"><span class=\"kw2666\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_syncbuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span class=\"t-lc\">std::osyncstream</span> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream\"><span class=\"kw2665\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_osyncstream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span class=\"t-lc\">std::wosyncstream</span> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream\"><span class=\"kw2665\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_osyncstream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h4 id=\"Predefined_standard_stream_objects\">Predefined standard stream objects</h4>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/iostream\">&lt;iostream&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cin</span><span>wcin</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> reads from the standard C input stream <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdin</a></span><br><span class=\"t-mark\">(global object)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cout</span><span>wcout</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> writes to the standard C output stream <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdout</a></span><br><span class=\"t-mark\">(global object)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cerr\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cerr</span><span>wcerr</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> writes to the standard C error stream <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stderr</a></span>, unbuffered<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(global object)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/clog\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>clog</span><span>wclog</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> writes to the standard C error stream <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stderr</a></span><br><span class=\"t-mark\">(global object)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h4 id=\"I.2FO_Manipulators\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip\">I/O Manipulators</a></h4>\n<p>The stream-based I/O library uses <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip\">I/O manipulators</a> (e.g. <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\">std::boolalpha</a></span>, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/hex\">std::hex</a></span>, etc.) to control how streams behave.\n</p>\n<h4 id=\"Types\">Types</h4>\n<p>The following auxiliary types are defined:\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ios\">&lt;ios&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/streamoff\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>streamoff</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  represents relative file/stream position (offset from fpos), sufficient to represent any file size <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(typedef)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/streamsize\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>streamsize</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  represents the number of characters transferred in an I/O operation or the size of an I/O buffer <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(typedef)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/fpos\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fpos</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  represents absolute position in a stream or a file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>The following typedef names for <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/fpos\"><span class=\"kw1822\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fpos</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/multibyte/mbstate_t\"><span class=\"kw1187\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mbstate_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span> are provided: \n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/iosfwd\">&lt;iosfwd&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>std::streampos</code>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/fpos\"><span class=\"kw1822\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fpos</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/char_traits\"><span class=\"kw1275\">std::<span class=\"me2\">char_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">state_type</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>std::wstreampos</code>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/fpos\"><span class=\"kw1822\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fpos</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/char_traits\"><span class=\"kw1275\">std::<span class=\"me2\">char_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">state_type</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>std::u8streampos</code> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/fpos\"><span class=\"kw1822\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fpos</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/char_traits\"><span class=\"kw1275\">std::<span class=\"me2\">char_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>char8_t<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">state_type</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>std::u16streampos</code> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/fpos\"><span class=\"kw1822\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fpos</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/char_traits\"><span class=\"kw1275\">std::<span class=\"me2\">char_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char16_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">state_type</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>std::u32streampos</code> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/fpos\"><span class=\"kw1822\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fpos</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/char_traits\"><span class=\"kw1275\">std::<span class=\"me2\">char_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char32_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">state_type</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><span id=\"Error_category_interface\"></span>\n</p>\n<h4 id=\"Error_category_interface_.28since_C.2B.2B11.29\">Error category interface <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></h4>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ios\">&lt;ios&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/io_errc\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>io_errc</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  the IO stream error codes <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(enum)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/iostream_category\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>iostream_category</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  identifies the iostream error category <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><span id=\"Print_functions\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Print_functions_.28since_C.2B.2B23.29\">Print functions <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span></h3>\n<p>The Unicode-aware print-family functions that perform formatted I/O on text that is already formatted. They bring all the performance benefits of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format/format\">std::format</a></span>, are locale-independent by default, reduce global state, avoid allocating a temporary <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\">std::string</a></span> object and calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span></span></code>, and in general make formatting more efficient compared to <a href=\"#Stream-based_I.2FO\">iostreams</a> and <a href=\"#C-style_I.2FO\">stdio</a>. \n</p><p>The following print-like functions are provided:\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/print\">&lt;print&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/print\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>print</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  prints to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdout</a></span> or a file stream using <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format\">formatted</a> representation of the arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>println</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  same as <span class=\"t-lc\">std::print</span> except that each print is terminated by additional new line <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/vprint_unicode\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>vprint_unicode</span><span>vprint_unicode_buffered</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  prints to Unicode capable <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdout</a></span> or a file stream using <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format/basic_format_args\">type-erased</a> argument representation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/vprint_nonunicode\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>vprint_nonunicode</span><span>vprint_nonunicode_buffered</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  prints to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdout</a></span> or a file stream using <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format/basic_format_args\">type-erased</a> argument representation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-sep\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ostream\">&lt;ostream&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/print\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>print<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::ostream)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  outputs <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format\">formatted</a> representation of the arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/println\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>println<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::ostream)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  outputs <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format\">formatted</a> representation of the arguments with appended <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span></span></code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"C-style_I.2FO\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c\">C-style I/O</a></h3>\n<p>C++ also includes the <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c\">input/output functions defined by C</a>, such as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fopen\">std::fopen</a></span>, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fgetc\">std::getc</a></span>, etc.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem\">Filesystem library</a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Stream-based I/O","id":"Stream-based_I.2FO"},{"depth":4,"text":"Typedefs","id":"Typedefs"},{"depth":4,"text":"Predefined standard stream objects","id":"Predefined_standard_stream_objects"},{"depth":4,"text":"I/O Manipulators","id":"I.2FO_Manipulators"},{"depth":4,"text":"Types","id":"Types"},{"depth":4,"text":"Error category interface (since C++11)","id":"Error_category_interface_.28since_C.2B.2B11.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"Print functions (since C++23)","id":"Print_functions_.28since_C.2B.2B23.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"C-style I/O","id":"C-style_I.2FO"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"}],"children":[{"path":"io/basic_filebuf","title":"std::basic_filebuf"},{"path":"io/basic_fstream","title":"std::basic_fstream"},{"path":"io/basic_ifstream","title":"std::basic_ifstream"},{"path":"io/basic_ios","title":"std::basic_ios"},{"path":"io/basic_iostream","title":"std::basic_iostream"},{"path":"io/basic_ispanstream","title":"std::basic_ispanstream"},{"path":"io/basic_istream","title":"std::basic_istream"},{"path":"io/basic_istringstream","title":"std::basic_istringstream"},{"path":"io/basic_ofstream","title":"std::basic_ofstream"},{"path":"io/basic_ospanstream","title":"std::basic_ospanstream"},{"path":"io/basic_ostream","title":"std::basic_ostream"},{"path":"io/basic_ostringstream","title":"std::basic_ostringstream"},{"path":"io/basic_osyncstream","title":"std::basic_osyncstream"},{"path":"io/basic_spanbuf","title":"std::basic_spanbuf"},{"path":"io/basic_spanstream","title":"std::basic_spanstream"},{"path":"io/basic_streambuf","title":"std::basic_streambuf"},{"path":"io/basic_stringbuf","title":"std::basic_stringbuf"},{"path":"io/basic_stringstream","title":"std::basic_stringstream"},{"path":"io/basic_syncbuf","title":"std::basic_syncbuf"},{"path":"io/c","title":"C-style file input/output"},{"path":"io/cerr","title":"std::cerr, std::wcerr"},{"path":"io/cin","title":"std::cin, std::wcin"},{"path":"io/clog","title":"std::clog, std::wclog"},{"path":"io/cout","title":"std::cout, std::wcout"},{"path":"io/fpos","title":"std::fpos"},{"path":"io/io_errc","title":"std::io_errc"},{"path":"io/ios_base","title":"std::ios_base"},{"path":"io/iostream_category","title":"std::iostream_category"},{"path":"io/istrstream","title":"std::istrstream"},{"path":"io/manip","title":"Input/output manipulators"},{"path":"io/ostrstream","title":"std::ostrstream"},{"path":"io/print","title":"std::print"},{"path":"io/println","title":"std::println"},{"path":"io/streamoff","title":"std::streamoff"},{"path":"io/streamsize","title":"std::streamsize"},{"path":"io/strstream","title":"std::strstream"},{"path":"io/strstreambuf","title":"std::strstreambuf"},{"path":"io/vprint_nonunicode","title":"std::vprint_nonunicode, std::vprint_nonunicode_buffered"},{"path":"io/vprint_unicode","title":"std::vprint_unicode, std::vprint_unicode_buffered"}],"map":{"label":"Input/output library","children":[{"label":"Stream-based I/O","note":"The stream-based input/output library is organized around abstract input/output devices.","children":[{"label":"Typedefs","note":"The following typedefs for common character types are provided in namespace std:"},{"label":"Predefined standard stream objects"},{"label":"I/O Manipulators","note":"The stream-based I/O library uses I/O manipulators (e.g. std::boolalpha, std::hex, etc.) to control how streams behave."},{"label":"Types","note":"The following auxiliary types are defined:"},{"label":"Error category interface (since C++11)"}]},{"label":"Print functions (since C++23)","note":"The Unicode-aware print-family functions that perform formatted I/O on text that is already formatted.","children":[{"label":"print","note":"prints to stdout or a file stream using formatted representation of the arguments"},{"label":"println","note":"same as std::print except that each print is terminated by additional new line"},{"label":"vprint_unicode, vprint_unicode_buffered","note":"prints to Unicode capable stdout or a file stream using type-erased argument representation"},{"label":"vprint_nonunicode, vprint_nonunicode_buffered","note":"prints to stdout or a file stream using type-erased argument representation"},{"label":"print(std::ostream)","note":"outputs formatted representation of the arguments"},{"label":"println(std::ostream)","note":"outputs formatted representation of the arguments with appended '\\n'"}]},{"label":"C-style I/O","note":"C++ also includes the input/output functions defined by C, such as std::fopen, std::getc, etc."},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":["C++98","C++11","C++17","C++20","C++23","C++26"],"wordCount":857,"codeBlockCount":0}
